rough }\r\ntr.shaded_dimmed     { background-color: #9FA48D; color: #666666 }\r\ntr.atwill            { background-color: #238E23; color: #FFFFFF }\r\ntr.encounter         { background-color: #8B0000; color: #FFFFFF }\r\ntr.daily             { background-color: #000000; color: #FFFFFF }\r\ntr.warning           { background-color: #E5A0A0; color: #000000; text-align: center }\r\ntd                   { padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px; vertical-align: top }\r\ntd.clear             { vertical-align: top; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px }\r\ntd.indent            { padding-left: 15px }\r\ntd.readaloud         { font-style: italic }\r\ntd.dimmed            { color: #666666 }\r\ntd.pvlogentry        { color: lightgrey; background-color: #000000 }\r\ntd.pvlogindent       { color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #000000; padding-left: 15px }\r\nul, ol               { font-size: 8pt }\r\na                    { text-decoration: none }\r\na:link               { color: #0000C0 }\r\na:visited            { color: #0000C0 }\r\na:active             { color: #FF0000 }\r\na.missing            { color: #FF0000 }\r\na:hover              { text-decoration: underline }\r\n</STYLE>\r\n<BODY>\r\n<P class=table>\r\n<TABLE style = \"min-width: 350px; max-width: 400px\">\r\n<TR class=creature>\r\n<TD colspan=2>\r\n<B>Aboleth Lasher</B>\r\n<BR>\r\nLarge aberrant magical beast (aquatic)\r\n</TD>\r\n<TD>\r\n<B>Level 17 Brute</B>\r\n<BR>\r\n1600 XP\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=2>\r\n<B>HP</B> 200; <B>Bloodied</B> 100\r\n</TD>\r\n<TD>\r\n<B>Initiative</B> +11\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=2>\r\n<B>AC</B> 29; <B>Fort</B> 27; <B>Ref</B> 25; <B>Will</B> 25\r\n</TD>\r\n<TD>\r\nPerception +14\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=2>\r\n<B>Speed</B> 5, swim 10\r\n</TD>\r\n<TD rowspan=1>darkvision</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=creature>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<B>Traits</B>\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=shaded>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<img src=data:image/png;base64,>\r\n<B>Mucus Haze</B>\r\n &diams; Aura 5\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\nenemies treat the area within the aura as difficult terrain.\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=creature>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<B>Standard Actions</B>\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=shaded>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<img src=data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAA4AAAAOCAMAAAAolt3jAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAARnQU1BAACxjwv8YQUAAAAMUExURQAAAP///4yLi////115NQMAAAAEdFJOU////wBAKqn0AAAACXBIWXMAAA7DAAAOwwHHb6hkAAAAQklEQVQYV1XPQQ4AIAgDQQL//7Pp0ibiiQFErJmZ4hAB58RFkxCRW91pWmaKlyUSwNalnZ1H0/szazBqa/R3ljxfeJ0eAXe3eWu9AAAAAElFTkSuQmCC><B>Tentacle</B> &diams; At-Will (basic attack)\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\nRange: Reach 2<BR>Attack: +20 vs AC<BR>2d8 + 8 damage (4d8 + 8 damage against a dazed target), and the target is dazed (save ends).\r\nCombat Advantage: An aboleth lasher makes an extra tentacle attack against any enemy it has combat advantage against.\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=shaded>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<B>Skills</B> Arcana +19, Dungeoneering +19, Insight +19\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=shaded>\r\n<TD>\r\n<B>Str</B>: 26 (+16)\r\n<BR>\r\n<B>Con</B>: 20 (+13)\r\n</TD>\r\n<TD>\r\n<B>Dex</B>: 16 (+11)\r\n<BR>\r\n<B>Int</B>: 23 (+14)\r\n</TD>\r\n<TD>\r\n<B>Wis</B>: 22 (+14)\r\n<BR>\r\n<B>Cha</B>: 17 (+11)\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<B>Alignment</B> Evil\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<B>Languages</B> Deep Speech, telepathy 20\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\n<B>Tactics</B> The aboleth lasher relies on its mucus haze to hinder its opponents&rsquo; movement while simultaneously using it to gain combat advantage with its allies. Once it covers an enemy with slime, it uses its tentacles to flay the hapless creature to death.\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n<TR class=shaded>\r\n<TD colspan=3>\r\nMonster Manual\r\n</TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n</P>\r\n</BODY>\r\n</HTML>";